<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Something Honest</title>

  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      background: linear-gradient(160deg, #1a1a2e, #16213e, #0f3460);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 20px;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .card {
      max-width: 720px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 45px;
      text-align: center;
      animation: fadeIn 1.3s ease;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 2.4rem;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .name {
      color: #f7b2c4;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      line-height: 1.75;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
      opacity: 0.95;
    }

    .image-box {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      margin: 28px 0;
    }

    .image-box img {
      width: 190px;
      height: 190px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      object-fit: cover;
      border: 3px solid rgba(247,178,196,0.6);
      box-shadow: 0 0 35px rgba(247,178,196,0.45);
      animation: glow 3s infinite;
    }

    @keyframes glow {
      0% { box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(247,178,196,0.3); }
      50% { box-shadow: 0 0 45px rgba(247,178,196,0.6); }
      100% { box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(247,178,196,0.3); }
    }

    .question {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      margin: 30px 0 18px;
    }

    .buttons {
      display: flex;
      gap: 16px;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    button {
      padding: 13px 26px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      border-radius: 30px;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }

    .yes {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f7b2c4, #ffd6e0);
      color: #000;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .yes:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .think {
      background: transparent;
      border: 1px solid #fff;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .think:hover {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    }

    .note {
      margin-top: 22px;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      opacity: 0.8;
    }

    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="card">
    <h1>Hi <span class="name">Labakeami</span> 💗</h1>

    <p>
I wanted to do this thoughtfully, because how we met may be online — but what we’ve shared feels genuine.
    </p>

    <div class="image-box">
      <img src="amina.jpg" alt="Amina">
    </div>

    <p>
      You’re the kind of woman who thinks about growth, purpose, and the future.
You inspire me to want more from life and from myself.
Since we met, I’ve felt encouraged, supported, and pushed toward becoming better — not pressured, just believed in.
    </p>

    <p>
      There’s no pressure here.  
      Just honesty and respect.
    </p>
    
    <p> 
    We haven’t met in person yet, and I respect that real connection takes time and presence.
Still, I value what we’re building and I’m excited about the possibility of seeing where it can lead — naturally and at the right pace.
</p> 


    <div class="question">
      Would you like to be my girlfriend?
    </div>

    <div class="buttons">
      <button class="yes" onclick="sendYes()">Yes 💕</button>
      <button class="think" onclick="sendThink()">I’d like to think about it</button>
    </div>

    <div class="note">
      Whatever you choose, thank you for taking the time to read this 🌷
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    function sendYes() {
      const text = encodeURIComponent(
        "Hey 😊 I saw what you made for me, and yes… I’d love to be your girlfriend 💕"
      );
      window.location.href =
        "https://wa.me/2348061968386?text=" + text;
    }

    function sendThink() {
      const text = encodeURIComponent(
        "Hey 🌸 I saw the website. It was really thoughtful. I’d like some time to think about it."
      );
      window.location.href =
        "https://wa.me/2348071968386?text=" + text;
    }
  </script>

</body>
</html>
	